OL,3,ABrazil election goes to run-off as
OL,4,Aright-wing Flavio Bolsonaro wins first
OL,5,Around
OL,6,
OL,7,FSunday's vote was close, with President
OL,8,FLula polling slightly ahead during the
OL,9,Fcampaign. With almost all of the votes
OL,10,Fcounted, Bolsonaro had 47.03% to Lula's
OL,11,F45.16% of the vote.
